&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text5" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　     負債合計                162,291千THB      (  634百万円)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:27pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
